      "quote": "However, there is little information about the relationship between biomarkers and death in COPD.",
      "reason": "The introduction states an existing knowledge gap regarding biomarkers (including mortality) in COPD."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "Given above, effective biomarkers are sought for determining the acute attack frequency, length of hospitalization, severity of morbidity, and mortality.",
