      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e4",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "It has been shown that PCT-guided antibiotic therapy can safely reduce antibiotic overuse in patients with AECOPD [10].",
      "reason": "This review is described as assessing the prognostic value of procalcitonin for predicting mortality, not the effects of an intervention; the evidence does not provide a brief proposed mechanism of action for an intervention effect."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e5",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No logic model for hypothesised relationships between intervention components and outcomes is provided in the retrieved evidence, and the evidence does not indicate a complex intervention requiring such a model."
