      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "Studies fulfilling the following selection criteria were included in this meta-analysis: (1) the type of study design was observational research, (2) the relationship between procalcitonin and mortality in patients with AECOPD, (3) diagnosis of COPD based on guidelines from the Global Initiative for Chronic Obstructive Lung Disease (GOLD). Reviews, case reports, conference abstracts, and animal experiments were excluded.",
      "reason": "Inclusion/exclusion study characteristics (observational design; PCT–mortality relationship in AECOPD; COPD diagnosis via GOLD) and exclusion of specific study types are specified, but the evidence does not clearly specify eligible settings and any follow-up requirement for eligibility."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "Weconducted a systematic search of the PubMed, EMBASE and Cochrane Library databases for articles published up to October 2023 in any language.",
      "reason": "Dissemination time window (published up to October 2023) and language ('any language') are specified, but publication/report status criteria (e.g., unpublished/gray literature) are not explicitly stated."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No evidence is provided that the review distinguishes exclusions where outcomes were not measured versus exclusions where outcome results were not reported."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_13",
      "quote": "Subgroup analysis was performed based on the severity of disease. Severe cases are defined as requiring intubation or mechanical ventilation, and others as mild to moderate.",
      "reason": "The evidence specifies groups for subgroup synthesis (severe vs mild-to-moderate based on need for intubation/mechanical ventilation). However, it does not explicitly link these groups to the specific comparisons in the review objectives within the retrieved evidence."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The evidence lists inclusion/exclusion restrictions but does not provide rationales for notable eligibility restrictions."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 72
